which I've just discovered for myself...(inserting lots of newlines)








































When in a shop CALL the shopkeeper by some new name (use the C command). The
shopkeeper doesn't appear to be renamed, but if you leave the shop and then
come back in you get "This shop appears to be deserted", even though the
shopkeeper is still there! Needless to say you can just pick everything up and
be on your way.

